<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Boland Bank to apply for share delisting.</title>
<headline>Boland Bank to apply for share delisting.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Application would be made to the Johannesburg Stock Exchange to terminate Boland Bank Holdings listing to facilitate the company's merger with NBS Holdings Ltd, the companies said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>NBS Holdings and Boland announced in December last year that they planned to merge.</p>
<p>Boland Bank Holdings and Boland Bank would be would up voluntarily, the companies said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
